{"seconds": 120.0, "exit": 0, "final": "---\n\n## Coaching Note\n\nThe Black king ventured to g5 and walked into a trap. **h4+** is devastating because it forces a choice:\n- If Kf4 (advancing), then Qf5 is checkmate\u2014the king has no escape because your pawn on d5 controls e4, your queen controls e5 and f4, and the pawns cage it in.\n- If Kxh4 (capturing), Black's king is still hunted in the open.\n\n**Key lesson:** When your opponent's king is exposed and you have pawns or pieces nearby, look for forcing checks that limit escape squares. The best moves often combine a check with terrain you already control.\n\n---\n\n```json\n{\"move\": \"h4+\", \"line\": [\"h4+\", \"Kf4\", \"Qf5#\"], \"motifs\": [\"attraction\"]}\n```", "tool_calls": [{"tool": "skill", "args": {"skill": "chess-coach"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-board", "args": {"fen": "8/p6p/4Q3/3P2k1/6P1/7P/3q1P1K/2r5 w - - 1 34"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-threats", "args": {"fen": "8/p6p/4Q3/3P2k1/6P1/7P/3q1P1K/2r5 w - - 1 34"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-line_view", "args": {"fen": "8/p6p/4Q3/3P2k1/6P1/7P/3q1P1K/2r5 w - - 1 34", "square": "e6"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-line_view", "args": {"fen": "8/p6p/4Q3/3P2k1/6P1/7P/3q1P1K/2r5 w - - 1 34", "square": "d2"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-line_view", "args": {"fen": "8/p6p/4Q3/3P2k1/6P1/7P/3q1P1K/2r5 w - - 1 34", "square": "c1"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-square_info", "args": {"fen": "8/p6p/4Q3/3P2k1/6P1/7P/3q1P1K/2r5 w - - 1 34", "square": "g5"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-square_info", "args": {"fen": "8/p6p/4Q3/3P2k1/6P1/7P/3q1P1K/2r5 w - - 1 34", "square": "h4"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-square_info", "args": {"fen": "8/p6p/4Q3/3P2k1/6P1/7P/3q1P1K/2r5 w - - 1 34", "square": "f4"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-legal_moves", "args": {"fen": "8/p6p/4Q3/3P2k1/6P1/7P/3q1P1K/2r5 w - - 1 34"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-inspect_move", "args": {"fen": "8/p6p/4Q3/3P2k1/6P1/7P/3q1P1K/2r5 w - - 1 34", "move": "h4"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-inspect_move", "args": {"fen": "8/p6p/4Q3/3P2k1/6P1/7P/3q1P1K/2r5 w - 